{"title":"2026 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Carley went for a run on May 18th. She did not go for a run on May 19th. She continued to alternate going for a run one day with not going for a run the following day. Between May 18th and May 25th inclusive, how many days did she go for a run?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe717b9845d2d8f6757745612ec225e15af3851.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\   6  \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\   3  \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\   7 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\   4  \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"384\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>She went for a walk on May 18, then skipped the next day. She repeats this cycle of skipping one day before taking another walk. Because of this we know that she walked on May 18, 20, 22, and 24, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/a/29a719bfd1e15aeb1523f960641e754917650abe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"56\" height=\"30\" /> days.\n</p><p>~any1sgame\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018034545\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\n